<body>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>1. Leftover Concept</h2>
        <input type="text" id="recipeName" placeholder="e.g., Leftover Pulled Pork Taco Bowls">
        <textarea id="recipeDetails" rows="3" placeholder="e.g., Quick lunch execution. Reheat pork in skillet with cumin, layer over rice, crunch up leftover tortilla chips."></textarea>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>2. Caption Angle Order</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 10px;">Tap to select and sequence your narrative structures:</p>
        <div class="grid" id="anglesContainer">
            <div class="angle-card" data-angle="hook">
                <div class="order"></div>
                <strong>The Hook</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px;">Stop the scroll with the core transformation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="angle-card" data-angle="problem">
                <div class="order"></div>
                <strong>The Problem</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px;">Addressing fridge fatigue and food waste.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="angle-card" data-angle="process">
                <div class="order"></div>
                <strong>The Process</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px;">Step-by-step assembly mechanics.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="angle-card" data-angle="cta">
                <div class="order"></div>
                <strong>The CTA</strong>
                <p style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 4px;">Prompt to save, share, or comment.</p>
            </div>
