    <div class="section">
        <h2>3. Callouts & Sign-offs</h2>
        <div class="chip-container" id="calloutsContainer">
            <div class="chip" data-text="⏱️ Ready in under 10 minutes.">⏱️ Sub-10 Mins</div>
            <div class="chip" data-text="💡 Pro-tip: Revive dried meats with a splash of broth during the reheat.">💡 Reheat Pro-Tip</div>
            <div class="chip" data-text="♻️ Zero-waste kitchen win.">♻️ Zero Waste</div>
            <div class="chip" data-text="📌 Drop your current leftover dilemma below and let's fix it.">💬 Drop Dilemma CTA</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
        <h2>4. Hashtag Groups</h2>
        <div class="chip-container" id="hashtagsContainer">
            <div class="chip" data-tags="#LeftoverMakeover #ZeroWasteKitchen #ScrappyCooking">♻️ Leftover Core</div>
            <div class="chip" data-tags="#QuickMeals #WeeknightDinner #EasyRecipes">⏱️ Fast Cooking</div>
